ARTICLE II — GRANT OF LICENSE
================================================================================

2.1  Subject to full compliance with all terms and conditions of this License,
     the Licensor hereby grants to You a limited, non-exclusive,
     non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable license to:

     (a) Use the Software for personal, non-commercial purposes, including
         playing chess, studying chess, self-improvement, and entertainment

     (b) Use the Software for educational purposes in academic institutions,
         schools, universities, chess clubs, and non-profit educational
         organizations, provided no tuition or fee is charged specifically
         for access to or use of the Software

     (c) Use the Software for academic and scientific research purposes,
         including but not limited to: artificial intelligence research,
         game theory research, search algorithm research, and computer
         science education, provided such research is not funded by or
         conducted on behalf of a for-profit entity for commercial purposes

     (d) Study, inspect, and analyze the source code for the purpose of
         learning programming techniques, chess programming concepts, and
         software architecture

     (e) Modify the source code solely for Your own personal, educational,
         or research use, provided such modifications are not Distributed

     (f) Participate in non-commercial chess engine competitions, rating
         lists, and benchmarking events, provided that:
         - The engine is clearly identified as "Luminex"
         - Proper attribution to the original authors is given
         - The competition does not generate revenue for the participant
           through the use of the Software
         - The competition rules are fully complied with

     (g) Deploy the WebAssembly version of the Software on personal or
         non-commercial websites, provided that:
         - The website is freely accessible to all users at no cost
         - No revenue is generated from the deployment (no ads, paywalls,
           subscriptions, or premium tiers related to the Software)
         - Proper attribution is clearly displayed to end users
         - The deployed version is unmodified or clearly marked as modified

2.2  No other rights are granted. Any rights not expressly granted in this
     License are reserved by the Licensor.

