ARTICLE III — RESTRICTIONS AND PROHIBITED USES
================================================================================

3.1  COMMERCIAL USE PROHIBITION
     You shall not use the Software for any Commercial Use as defined in
     Section 1.4. This prohibition applies regardless of the scale of
     commercial activity and includes indirect commercial benefit.

3.2  ILLEGAL USE PROHIBITION
     You shall not use the Software for any purpose that violates any
     applicable local, state, national, or international law, regulation,
     or ordinance, including but not limited to:

     (a) Cheating in any chess competition, tournament, match, or rated game,
         whether online or over-the-board, including but not limited to:
         using engine assistance during play, relaying engine moves to a
         player, or integrating the Software with any platform in a way that
         circumvents fair play policies

     (b) Bypassing, circumventing, or disabling any security measure,
         anti-cheat system, or fair play monitoring system used by any chess
         platform, tournament organizer, or governing body

     (c) Fraud, deception, misrepresentation, or any form of dishonest
         activity involving the Software

     (d) Unauthorized access to computer systems, networks, or data

     (e) Any violation of the laws and regulations of the Fédération
         Internationale des Échecs (FIDE), any national chess federation,
         or any online chess platform's terms of service

     (f) Any activity that would constitute a criminal offense under
         applicable law

3.3  INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RESTRICTIONS
     You shall not:

     (a) Remove, alter, obscure, or falsify any copyright notice, license
         terms, trademark, branding, or attribution present in or on the
         Software or any associated documentation

     (b) Claim authorship or ownership of the Software or any portion
         thereof, except for modifications You have personally made and
         clearly documented as Your own

     (c) Register, apply for, or attempt to obtain any patent, trademark,
         or other intellectual property right that would restrict the
         Licensor's rights in the Software

     (d) Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any binary
         distribution of the Software, except to the extent that such
         activity is expressly permitted by applicable law despite this
         limitation, and only for the purpose of achieving interoperability
         with independently created software

     (e) Use the Luminex name, logo, branding, or any confusingly similar
         marks to endorse, promote, or market any product, service, or
         entity without prior written consent from the Licensor

3.4  DISTRIBUTION RESTRICTIONS
     You shall not:

     (a) Distribute Derivative Works without prior written consent from
         the Licensor

     (b) Distribute the Software through any channel that imposes additional
         restrictions on recipients that conflict with this License

     (c) Distribute the Software in any form that intentionally obscures
         the source code availability or license terms

     (d) Bundle the Software with malware, spyware, adware, or any other
         malicious or unwanted software

     (e) Distribute the Software on any platform or marketplace that
         charges users for access to the Software

3.5  HARMFUL USE PROHIBITION
     You shall not use the Software in connection with:

     (a) Any weapon system, military application, or tool of warfare

     (b) Any system designed to cause physical harm, psychological harm,
         or environmental damage

     (c) Any system designed to harass, stalk, bully, or intimidate
         any individual or group

     (d) Any system designed to discriminate against individuals or groups
         based on race, ethnicity, gender, religion, sexual orientation,
         disability, or any other protected characteristic

     (e) Any mass surveillance system or tool that infringes on
         privacy rights

